          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi Daudi na nyumba yote ya Israeli wakalileta sanduku la BWANA kwa shangwe, na kwa sauti ya tarumbeta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikawa, sanduku la BWANA lilipoingia mji wa Daudi, Mikali binti Sauli, akachungulia dirishani, akamwona mfalme Daudi akirukaruka na kucheza mbele za BWANA; akamdharau moyoni mwake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
